    {
      "clip_id": "T00",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        0,
        6
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [],
      "text": "遥控器，如何定案？AMI ES2002d；研究项目情境会议，非企业发布、非量产或性能实测。"
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T01",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        6,
        38
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S4",
        "S2"
      ],
      "text": "上次计划／本次橡皮泥原型。翻开结构太贵改LCD、滚轮与确认键。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C01",
        "C02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T02",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        38,
        72
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S4",
        "S2"
      ],
      "text": "动能取消只用电池；初始16.8、预算12.5；2.3现场纠错为4.3。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C03",
        "C04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T03",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        72,
        97
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S4",
        "S3"
      ],
      "text": "删LCD与高级芯片，单曲面只是备选；12功能按4个估价；去数字键盘特殊色非全机取消黄色。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C05",
        "C06",
        "C07",
        "C08"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T04",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        97,
        119.6
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S4",
        "S1"
      ],
      "text": "0.5是中途余额；计入标志造型，最终预算内；电视反馈替代LCD。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C05",
        "C09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T05",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        119.6,
        157.8
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S2",
        "S3",
        "S4"
      ],
      "text": "原型不等于量产设想；模型材料不足；厚度2→2.5厘米是估计。布局创新让位于熟悉性。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C10",
        "C11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T06",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        157.8,
        212.6
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S1",
        "S2",
        "S3",
        "S4"
      ],
      "text": "离座评价者；黄色受欢迎疑虑；1高7低，风格2.5、创新3、软弹5，非性能测试。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C12",
        "C13",
        "C14",
        "C15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T07",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        212.6,
        229.4
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S1"
      ],
      "text": "评价后追加立体形态／系列色系，仅建议，未获批准，可放弃。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T08",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        229.4,
        267.6
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S1",
        "S3",
        "S4"
      ],
      "text": "room误会及澄清；水果色与公司色约束冲突；设备阻隔不是团队气氛紧张。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C17",
        "C18",
        "C19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T09",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        267.6,
        307.48
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S1",
        "S3",
        "S4"
      ],
      "text": "自由授权理想与受限框架；不是坏领导；控制一词遭反驳，结构化分工与共识决策。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C20",
        "C21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T10",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        307.48,
        335.76
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S2",
        "S1",
        "S4"
      ],
      "text": "会外交流限制但团队已尽力；会议限时有益，概念设计可多15分钟。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C22",
        "C23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T11",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        335.76,
        351.48
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [
        "S3"
      ],
      "text": "宣布收尾之后：实体原型／触觉／橡皮泥生成点子的反思。",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "T12",
      "kind": "title",
      "track": "V2+V3",
      "output_range": [
        351.48,
        356.48
      ],
      "source": null,
      "source_range": null,
      "relationship": "editorial_title",
      "speaker_ids": [],
      "text": "定案不等于所有疑虑解决；AMI Meeting Corpus / ES2002d，CC BY 4.0。",
      "claim_ids": [
